(%s)␀Task Browser␀␀␀␀Less␀␀␀␀More␀␀␀␀Can't rename .CUP files␀Rename Error␀␀␀␀.tsk␀␀␀␀Delete␀␀Rename␀␀Load the selected task?␀Remove task point?␀␀Task point␀␀Enable Alternate Starts␀Edit Alternates␀%s (%d)␀Start point␀Start: ␀Assigned area point␀Finish point␀␀␀␀Finish: ␀␀␀␀Remove␀␀Relocate␀␀␀␀Score exit␀␀<␀␀␀Enter a task name␀␀␀A+␀␀A-␀␀âŒ«␀<-␀␀Clear␀␀␀Paste␀␀␀# That's it!

You can revisit the gesture help from the **Info** menu at any time.␀␀# After Your Flight

1. **Download logs** - Retrieve flight logs from your FLARM or logger device. [Config > Devices](xcsoar://config/devices)

2. **Analysis** - Review your flight statistics. [Info > Analysis](xcsoar://dialog/analysis)

3. **Status** - Check flight timing and statistics. [Info > Status](xcsoar://dialog/status)

4. **Upload** - Upload to WeGlide directly from XCSoar. Configure your WeGlide User ID in [Config > Services > WeGlide](xcsoar://config/weglide)␀# Preflight Checks

Before each flight, verify:

1. **Plane & Polar** - Correct aircraft and polar selected. [Config > Plane](xcsoar://config/planes)

2. **Flight parameters** - Wing loading, bugs, QNH, max temperature. [Info > Flight](xcsoar://dialog/flight)

3. **Wind** - Set wind manually or enable auto wind. [Info > Wind](xcsoar://dialog/wind)

4. **Task** - Create a task for navigation guidance. [Nav > Task Manager](xcsoar://dialog/task)␀␀The safety disclaimer must be accepted to use XCSoar. Quit?␀# Getting Started

To use XCSoar effectively, configure the following:

- [Restore from backup](xcsoar://dialog/backup) - Restore previous XCSoar data from a USB or SD card (optional)

- [%s] [Map and data](xcsoar://config/site-files) - Download maps, waypoints, and airspace files for your region

- [%s] [Aircraft polar](xcsoar://config/planes) - Set up your aircraft with the correct polar curve

- [%s] [Pilot info](xcsoar://config/logger) - Enter your name and weight

- [%s] [Devices](xcsoar://config/devices) - Connect your flight instruments

- [%s] [WeGlide](xcsoar://config/weglide) - Upload flights automatically to WeGlide

- [%s] [Thermal Information Map](xcsoar://config/weather) - Show thermal locations from thermalmap.info on the map

- [%s] [Safety factors](xcsoar://config/safety) - Set arrival height, terrain clearance and polar degradation

- [%s] [Terrain Display](xcsoar://config/terrain) - Choose terrain colors, shading and contour lines

␀␀␀Explore XCSoar easily by restarting in Simulator mode, or by [replaying an IGC flight](xcsoar://dialog/replay).␀%s (%u/%u)␀␀Welcome to XCSoar␀␀␀IDB_TITLE_HD_WHITE␀␀IDB_TITLE_HD␀␀␀␀**Simulator mode:** Drag from the glider to set direction and speed. Jump with **Sim: Jump to** on a waypoint or map point. Fine-tune height and speed with the **Altitude** and **Speed Ground** InfoBoxes.

␀␀To get the most out of XCSoar and to learn about its many functions in detail, it is highly recommended to read the Quick Guide or the complete documentation.␀␀Documentation is available in several languages. You can always access the latest versions online:␀␀XCSoar Manual & Quick Guide␀GitHub - Source Code & Contributions␀␀␀␀GitHub Discussions - Questions & Community␀␀![XCSoar Logo](resource:IDB_LOGO_HD)

