stom radius.␀␀␀␀A keyhole. Scored by farthest point reached in area.␀␀␀␀FAI rules, allows only FAI start, finish and turn point types, for badges and records. Enables FAI finish height for final glide calculation.␀␀␀FAI rules, path from a start to two turn points and return.␀FAI rules, path from start to a single turn point and return.␀␀␀FAI rules, path from start to a goal destination.␀␀␀Racing task around turn points. Can also be used for FAI badge and record tasks. Allows all shapes of observation zones.␀␀␀␀Task through assigned areas, minimum task time applies. Restricted to cylinder and sector observation zones.␀␀␀␀Modified area task. Task with start, finish and at least one predefined 1 mile cylinder. Pilot can add additional points as needed. Minimum task time applies.␀␀Racing task with a mix of assigned areas and turn points, minimum task time applies.␀␀␀␀Casual touring task, uses start and finish cylinders and FAI sector turn points.␀␀␀␀FAI badges/records␀␀FAI out and return␀␀FAI goal␀␀␀␀Racing␀␀Modified area task (MAT)␀␀␀␀No valid start␀␀No valid finish␀Task not closed␀All turnpoints not the same type␀␀␀␀Incorrect number of turnpoints␀␀Too many turnpoints␀Not enough turnpoints␀␀␀Turnpoints not unique␀␀␀Empty task␀␀non-FAI turn points␀non-MAT turn points␀Wrong shape␀Goal␀␀␀␀Out and return␀␀Two legs␀␀␀␀Three legs␀␀non-FAI triangle␀␀␀␀%d legs␀Task is empty (%s)␀␀max.␀␀␀␀min.␀␀␀␀%s%s%s%s%.0f %s%s%s %.0f %s%s%s %.0f %s (%s)␀␀␀␀dist.␀␀␀%s%s%s%s%s %.0f %s (%s)␀S: %s␀␀␀T%d: %s␀A%d: %s␀F: %s␀␀␀Radius␀␀%s - %s: %.1f%s␀Gate width␀␀MAT cylinder␀␀␀␀DAeC Keyhole␀␀␀␀BGA Fixed Course␀␀␀␀BGA Enhanced Option␀BGA Start Sector␀␀␀␀Angle␀␀␀%s - %s: %.1f%s, %s: %.1fÂ°␀%u.%03u␀vector::_M_range_insert␀Failed to update migrated profile: ␀Data layout migration: all %u file moves failed␀RaspFile␀␀␀␀ChecklistFile␀␀␀InputFile␀␀␀%+3d␀␀␀␀h AGL␀␀␀Error in file {}␀␀␀␀Loading airspaces␀␀␀Loading Airspace File...␀␀␀␀airspace.txt␀␀␀␀Failed to load airspaces from map file␀␀Bad angle␀␀␀%04u-%02